---
description: Repository structure rules for the Mango Tree local agent runtime.
globs: ["src/agent_runtime/**/*", "tests/**/*", "configs/**/*", "workflows/**/*", "docs/**/*.md"]
alwaysApply: false
---

Runtime code belongs under `src/agent_runtime/`, docs under `docs/`, and frontend code under `web/`. Use `uv` for Python. Keep orchestration, agents, workflows, tools, memory, storage, sandbox, schemas, and observability separated. Tests should include denied behavior for security boundaries.
